WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.132 --> 00:00:15.233
struggled to free himself from the golden rope.

2
00:00:16.574 --> 00:00:18.255
The gourd fell from his robe.

3
00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:21.898
"My magic gourd!"

4
00:00:22.338 --> 00:00:23.980
said Golden Horn, picking it up.

5
00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:29.744
He dragged Wukong to a dark room in the cave and locked him in.

6
00:00:36.104 --> 00:00:38.987
Right away Wukong made himself tiny and escaped.

7
00:00:41.549 --> 00:00:45.112
He flew down a tunnel and squeezed through the cave's main door.

8
00:00:46.893 --> 00:00:50.056
Once he was outside, he returned to his normal size.

9
00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:53.699
banged on the cave door.

10
00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.721
"Open up right now!"

11
00:00:57.322 --> 00:01:00.284
The door flew open and Golden Horn appeared.

12
00:01:02.206 --> 00:01:04.288
Wukong!" shouted the demon.

13
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.381
"How did you escape?"

14
00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:10.902
"I'm not Sun Wukong," the monkey lied.

15
00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:16.004
"But you look just like him," said Golden Horn.

16
00:01:16.024 --> 00:01:19.326
"Yes, I do," said Wukong.

17
00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:21.967
Wukong is my twin brother.

18
00:01:23.147 --> 00:01:24.728
My name is Sun Kongwu."

19
00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:29.570
"Why are you here, Sun Kongwu?"

20
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:30.910
asked Golden Horn.

21
00:01:32.231 --> 00:01:34.472
know you captured my brother," said Wukong.

22
00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:36.213
"Set him free."

23
00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:41.997
Horn laughed.

24
00:01:42.917 --> 00:01:44.939
"I'm not going to do that!"

25
00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:50.202
"Oh, that's too bad," said Wukong, pretending to feel bad.

26
00:01:50.222 --> 00:01:54.145
"I was hoping to solve this problem without violence."

27
00:01:55.466 --> 00:01:57.767
He took the iron bar out of his ear.

28
00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:04.212
Golden Horn had been holding the gourd behind his back the whole time.

29
00:02:05.152 --> 00:02:09.513
He quickly held it up and shouted, "Sun Kongwu!"

30
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:15.995
Wukong was sucked into the gourd.

31
00:02:17.295 --> 00:02:20.816
Golden Horn put a cap on the gourd and went back into his cave.

32
00:02:24.037 --> 00:02:25.978
the gourd Wukong stamped his foot.

33
00:02:25.998 --> 00:02:29.179
"How will I get out of here?

34
00:02:30.139 --> 00:02:33.140
I know I won't turn into liquid because I'm going to live forever.

35
00:02:34.464 --> 00:02:36.625
But I still have to save my friends."

36
00:02:38.286 --> 00:02:39.186
tapped his chin.

37
00:02:39.206 --> 00:02:42.648
"I have an idea."

38
00:02:44.249 --> 00:02:47.770
He plucked a hair and made it look almost exactly like himself.

39
00:02:49.091 --> 00:02:50.411
was just one difference.

40
00:02:51.452 --> 00:02:53.673
The fake Wukong had no legs.

41
00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:57.034
Next Wukong made a hair look like a puddle.

42
00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:00.296
He placed the fake Wukong on the puddle.

43
00:03:01.368 --> 00:03:05.350
Now it looked as if the fake Wukong's legs had turned into liquid.

44
00:03:06.291 --> 00:03:09.313
Then the monkey made himself very, very tiny.

45
00:03:10.213 --> 00:03:15.936
Wukong went near the opening of the gourd and shouted, "Oh no!

46
00:03:16.257 --> 00:03:18.538
My legs turned into liquid!"

47
00:03:21.099 --> 00:03:24.842
The gourd shot out light as Golden Horn removed the cap.

48
00:03:26.262 --> 00:03:28.824
The tiny Wukong leaped out, unseen.

49
00:03:30.828 --> 00:03:34.350
Golden Horn peered into the gourd and saw the fake Wukong in the puddle.

50
00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:40.073
"Ha-ha! The monkey's legs did turn into liquid.

51
00:03:40.874 --> 00:03:43.935
Soon his entire body will be liquid!"

52
00:03:46.397 --> 00:03:49.218
Golden Horn laughed again and closed the gourd.

53
00:03:50.879 --> 00:03:52.840
He put the gourd down and started eating.

54
00:03:54.321 --> 00:03:58.784
The real Wukong returned to his normal size and then made himself look like a demon.

55
00:04:02.668 --> 00:04:04.589
He walked over to Golden Horn.

56
00:04:09.593 --> 00:04:11.034
sir," said Wukong.

57
00:04:11.054 --> 00:04:12.935
"Are you enjoying your lunch?"

58
00:04:14.636 --> 00:04:16.377
"Yes," said Golden Horn.

59
00:04:18.179 --> 00:04:19.119
picked up the gourd.

60
00:04:19.139 --> 00:04:21.561
"Is Sun Kongwu still in here?"

61
00:04:23.982 --> 00:04:24.923
said Golden Horn.

62
00:04:24.943 --> 00:04:28.866
"He will turn completely into liquid soon.

63
00:04:30.487 --> 00:04:31.788
asking me questions.

64
00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.442
I'm trying to eat my lunch."

65
00:04:35.663 --> 00:04:37.985
Golden Horn tilted his head to take a drink.

66
00:04:39.346 --> 00:04:41.748
Wukong slipped the gourd into his robe.

67
00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.072
He quickly made a fake gourd with one of his hairs.

68
00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:49.695
He put it on the table and then ran outside.

69
00:04:51.717 --> 00:04:56.481
Wukong changed back into himself and then banged on the cave door again.

70
00:04:57.682 --> 00:04:59.404
Golden Horn threw the door open.

71
00:05:00.676 --> 00:05:03.777
"My name is Kong Sunwu," said Wukong.

72
00:05:04.678 --> 00:05:05.678
captured my nephews.

73
00:05:05.958 --> 00:05:07.019
Return them at once!"

74
00:05:08.459 --> 00:05:10.720
Golden Horn held up the fake gourd.

75
00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.262
"Kong Sun—" "Wow!"

76
00:05:14.522 --> 00:05:16.543
cried Wukong, interrupting the demon.

77
00:05:16.563 --> 00:05:19.904
"I have a gourd that looks just like that!"
